Z||000000||FieroLisa||12-07-2000||03:16 PM||||Just wondering how many people from this forum are from the NC area and will be at the meeting on the 16th? And can I get some directions to where we are meeting- I had them in email but they got erased. I will be there, minus the Fiero (both are still in Ohio)<BR><P>------------------<BR>Lisa<BR>86 gold 4 speed GT<BR>86 gold 5 speed SC (For Sale)<BR>Columbus, OH/Greensboro NC<BR>*Updated Website* <A HREF="http://www.geocities.com/fierolisa/" TARGET=_blank>http://www.geocities.com/fierolisa/</A> ||||reg||1
Z||000001||bHooper||12-07-2000||03:35 PM||||Lisa,<P>Where in Gbo will you be coming from?<P>The Golden Coral is easy to see, maybe difficult to figure out how to get to.  It is located between Sams Club and the Cracker Barrel, off of West Wendover... at I-40.<P>Hope that helps.  And as I said, the only thing that will keep me away is the football game... even if I have to drive my Jeep!<P>See ya there!<P>hoop||||reg||1
