Z||000003||Motorhead||12-07-2000||04:41 PM||||Details! Details!  Would like to be there!  The car is running great and needs a road trip.  Where and when is this gathering of Fieroholics?||||reg||1
Z||000004||bHooper||12-07-2000||04:51 PM||||Greensboro, NC <BR>Saturday, December 16th<BR>2:00 PM <BR>Golden Coral on West Wendover and I-40<P>Bob Englert renglert@triad.rr.com  is the person putting it all together.<P>it should be fun!<P>hopefully i will have my car on the road by then!||||reg||1
Z||000005||Motorhead||12-07-2000||05:11 PM||||Do you have an exit number?||||reg||1
Z||000006||Bob Englert||12-07-2000||05:47 PM||||The Golden Corral is at x214 on I-40.  We are shooting for 2:00 PM on the 16th.  Hopefully the lunch crowd will have thinned out some and this will give everyone a chance to drive over and get home at a decent time.<P>If you are coming from the east just take a left at the top of the Wendover Ave. exit ramp and then go right at the first full traffic light. GC will be right next to the Cracker Barrel.<P>If coming from the west take the first Wendover exit and stay in the right lane.  Right at the first light.  From the west you will see the Golden Corral on your right just before the exit.<P>No formal agenda, just trying to create an opportunity to meet other Fiero owners and see if there is any interest in any other activities in the Spring or Summer.<P>I look forward to meeting everyone soon.  Post or e-mail me if you have any other questions (or if you want a Fiero name badge for the meeting :-)).<P><P>------------------<BR>Bob<BR>2 - 87 GT's<BR>85 SE 4 cyl||||reg||1
